%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: ShorMoment2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, welcome back. I'm surprised you didn't show up when he did.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560960
    - rid: 1790118425451560961
    - rid: 1790118425451560965
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} looks around, trying to find this person that Shor''s talking about.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560966
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't see anybody, who are you talking to?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560962
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I was busy. My attention and essence isn't spread across the whole world
      like yours.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560963
    - rid: 1790118425451560964
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560968
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Shor, put that thing back where we had it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560971
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, sure, just ignore me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560972
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Come now, you would ask the god of freedom to go against his very nature?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560973
    - rid: 1790118425451560975
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Last time I work with a trickster god...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560976
    - rid: 1790118425451560977
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So this guy's the one you made that interface with?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560978
    - rid: 1790118425451560979
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560980
    - rid: 1790118425451560981
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Why is {mc} even here?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Because I brought him here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Why?!? Now I have to wipe his memory when I send him back to Tamriel-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451560983
    - rid: 1790118425451560982
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: The Elder Scrolls dragging him to the void was annoying enough-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I did warn you that the earthbones didn't like being bent, didn't
      I?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: The harder you push on them, the harder they push back; as a piece of
      Mundus myself, even I am forced to experience it involuntarily.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: The pains of trying to be lore-friendly, even in the face of such a convoluted
      cosmology.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey wait, if you made the interface, were you the one that dragged me
      and my friends to Skyrim?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561036
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm a bit surprised you have the... willingness to ask questions; I did
      say that I'll be wiping your memory after this.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I will! I have no idea what the hell is going on!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561038
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561039
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe I should've just worked with the original {mc} after all-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561041
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Your extra autonomy might be too troublesome when combined with the very
      world itself working against me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... What?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561044
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561040
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... It's probably too late to backtrack on my MC choice now...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: All the effort it would take to re-insert the original {mc} into this
      scenario would cause too much... pushback.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Scenario? What is this, some sort of simulation or something?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561047
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: No, I'm not taking the DDLC+ lore into account-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: But you wouldn't know about that, would you...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, you meant as in a game?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Because that's true.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh god...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561050
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah boohoo~
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561051
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: If you'd like, I can do the mindwipe now-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Get all of the existential baggage out of the way so you can get back
      to being an unwilling chosen hero archetype.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561052
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561053
    - rid: 1790118425451561054
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you just send him back to Tamriel...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561055
    - rid: 1790118425451561056
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Not personally, no.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Are your mind-wiping powers really determined by physical proximity?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561057
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: When it comes to interacting with this world, physical proximity might
      be my only metric to know what sort of data I should be working with.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Your limits fascinate me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: You would be fascinated by that, wouldn't you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Now he's probably going to go tell the girls the truth-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: And while I am a bit curious to see how they'd react-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: If they all know, it would spiral beyond my ability to course-correct.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: I, for one, rather enjoy emergence.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: They might even find a way to overpower even your influence, which would
      be quite interesting to see.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Bah. It'd be a real waste of my time if they get that far.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Why are you still here?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Go see what {mc}'s doing!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561068
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118425451561058
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
